WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Drowse wakes beneath the strategy table.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Pip says the emergency meeting is over.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Drowse checks the silent alarm bell.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The room is empty. One chair is smoking.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Did we win the meeting?
